{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35230","headline":"华清词 · 顾云","name":"华清词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祥云皓鹤盘碧空，乔松稍稍韵微风。\n绦节影来，朱旛响丁东。\n相公清斋朝蘂宫，太上符籙龙蛇踪。\n散花天女侍香童，隔烟遥望见云水。\n弹璈吹凤清珑珑，丹砂黄金世可度。\n愿啓一言告仙翁，道门弟子山中客。\n长向山中礼空碧，九色真龙上汉时，愿把霓幢引烟策。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}